 have her be I  don't want to go so far as to say a  beacon of hope but to be an active force  you know for the things she believes in  in a way that Logan really wasn't in  that film so something something this is  something I'd like to see anyway but I  would take this as a signifier that they  are not gonna do what I'm afraid they're  gonna do and that would be I want her in  the costume the x-23 costume couple  reasons first I just think it would look  cool but secondly it would show me that  they're not trying to make her be Logan  because you're putting on that costume  which is a costume  yeah it's obviously based off the  original Wolverine costume and it's one  we've never seen in a movie at all it  got teased in a deleted scene on the  Wolverine he's never worn it so it would  be taking the character it would be  taking her as a character in a different  direction but also giving her a frankly  slightly more comic book ish more heroic  feel and I think that's the right way to  go with the character and I think it's  an easily justified movies walk because  I'm sure there's some people going what  is that how grounded Logan was you've  got to put her in that costume yes I'm  gonna put her in that costume because  think about it she was reading these  comic books they get established in the  movie Logan so there are comic books  about the exploits of the x-men and they  are comic books up they're not accurate  but they were what became her vision and  those of other young news like her of  what the x-men were the reality of it is  almost irrelevant because this is the  myth and the legend of it and Wolverine  in that comic had the costume so in  terms of both trying to honor the  sacrifice that she made for her  also be the better version than the  reality ever was Shay could totally buy  and would encourage that she would make  and wear that costume and again it would  be such an indication that they're not  gonna try and just do the depressing  lightning in a bottle that was the first  Logan again that they are gonna move  things forward and again you don't have  to like make the world like suddenly you  know bright and cheery and and you know  MCU spider-man homecoming looking kind  of thing no just do that with her keep  the world the same sort of dirty used up  slightly barren kind of western desert  town feel that it had and Logan but you  can still move the characters forward  and not have them wallow in pain the way  that Logan did and none of these things  that I'm saying are criticisms of Logan  as a film it absolutely worked in that  film but it's not gonna work if they do  it again and I think it's basically a  matter of whether or not Fox gets out of  James Mangold's way now James Mangold is  not a perfect filmmaker I'm not like oh  he can't possibly mess this up but the  things that I'm afraid of are the sorts  of things that the corporate mentality  does because at the studio level at the  executive level they look at a success  and go oh that's what worked repeat as  many of those elements as we possibly  can and hopefully it'll work again  that's studio executive mentality and  that is what will kill an X 23 movie if  it in fact ever gets made so as long as  they leave him alone and let him make  his own movie and potentially make his  own mistakes as I said the man's human  he's not a perfect filmmaker but I think  we're gonna be in much better hands if  they just back off from this and let him  do whatever he's gonna do and as I said  I hope what he's gonna do would involve  the costume so those are my thoughts on  X 23 reasons to be excited but also  something to watch out for which is  often what I do it it can it can be hard  for me to be totally positive because  there's what there's a part of my brain  I can't stop from going okay yeah that's  good no but here's the ways it could go  wrong it's a thing that happens I'm  sorry in any case what are your thoughts  on the possibility of an ex 23  movie whatever they are good bad excited  nervous drop something down in the  comments let's talk about it don't  forget to like subscribe check me out on  Twitter at Council of geeks give a  listen to the council of geese podcast  available on iTunes and stitcher I am  also one half of the punch like a girl  podcast that can be found on the fire  and water podcast network fire and water  podcast.com and until next time this  council is adjourned  [Applause]  [Applause]

